# Security

## Auth & tenancy
- JWT required for mutating APIs
- Every plan query/command must enforce **owner (or member) authorization**
- Never trust client-supplied `userId` / `planId` without server checks

## Input & XSS
- Validate all DTOs (FluentValidation)
- Angular: bind text safely — no `innerHTML` for names/notes
- JSON import: schema validation + size limits; reject unknown shapes

## Data
- Soft-delete / audit for payment and settlement changes
- Do not log PII (full notes, bank refs) at Information in production
- Secrets only in env / user-secrets — never commit `.env` with keys

## Exports
- ICS/CSV/JSON downloads scoped to authorized plan only
- Print/PDF must not leak other users’ plans
